(7287406, 1135897, 96751, '<td valign="top">Expansive, but I don''t get the oppressive, repetitive feeling from this which is typical of Gursky''s work</td>', 'Expansive, but I don''t get the oppressive, repetitive feeling from this which is typical of Gursky''s work', '2014-11-24 11:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
