(7287408, 1135946, 96751, '<td valign="top">Why does this place look so familiar????  A very interesting (and effective) take on the style. More organic that structured, it still conveys that feeling of human insignificance in the face of his surroundings</td>', 'Why does this place look so familiar????  A very interesting (and effective) take on the style. More organic that structured, it still conveys that feeling of human insignificance in the face of his surroundings', '2014-11-24 11:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
