(7287426, 1135877, 124815, '<td valign="top">I was waiting for <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=8759" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tiberius</a> to participate in this challenge. And if it''s not him it''s definitely Hong Kong - never been there but read recently the childhood memoirs of Martin Booth and googled Kowloon and all the places he mentioned and gasped in amazement and sometimes in horror. <br/>I find this image perfect for what Gursky wants to show. Imagine it printed really large or imagine yourself there!</td>', 'I was waiting for  tiberius to participate in this challenge. And if it''s not him it''s definitely Hong Kong - never been there but read recently the childhood memoirs of Martin Booth and googled Kowloon and all the places he mentioned and gasped in amazement and sometimes in horror. I find this image perfect for what Gursky wants to show. Imagine it printed really large or imagine yourself there!', '2014-11-24 12:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
