(7287433, 1135919, 60173, '<td valign="top">I kind of wish you would have moved a tad to the right. I think part of the power of this photo is all those damn beans! If you moved a little to the right, the viewer would be left to wonder just how many bean types there were. As it is, I now know they stopped at the canned potatoes and onions.</td>', 'I kind of wish you would have moved a tad to the right. I think part of the power of this photo is all those damn beans! If you moved a little to the right, the viewer would be left to wonder just how many bean types there were. As it is, I now know they stopped at the canned potatoes and onions.', '2014-11-24 12:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287434, 1135955, 124815, '<td valign="top">That''s a jewel of an image where abstraction coexist with a sense of normality, the unknown with the familiar <br/>I find it somehow the opposite of Gursky just because here my interest is sparkled and the sameness does not alienate me.<br/>I give it a 10</td>', 'That''s a jewel of an image where abstraction coexist with a sense of normality, the unknown with the familiar I find it somehow the opposite of Gursky just because here my interest is sparkled and the sameness does not alienate me.I give it a 10', '2014-11-24 12:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
