(7288294, 1135877, 30049, '<td valign="top">Daggum!  That''s a whole lot of people!!!  Wow.  As much as I like this photo I can''t help but wonder how this would look in a square crop, losing the left area where you can see the roof top and sliver of night sky ... also losing the piece in the bottom (looks like another building encroaching.<br/> <br/>Still ... well seen.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Daggum!  That''s a whole lot of people!!!  Wow.  As much as I like this photo I can''t help but wonder how this would look in a square crop, losing the left area where you can see the roof top and sliver of night sky ... also losing the piece in the bottom (looks like another building encroaching. Still ... well seen.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2014-11-28 17:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
