(7288297, 1135741, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hovered on the 6, but couldn''t figure out what "untitled" meant ... so I slipped to a 5.  Good take overall on the challenge theme.</td>', 'Hovered on the 6, but couldn''t figure out what "untitled" meant ... so I slipped to a 5.  Good take overall on the challenge theme.', '2014-11-28 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288299, 1135902, 30049, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Might have liked it better with a tighter crop at the top ... just a little over the water horizon.  Title it "Layers", although "Pacific" works just fine too.   :-P  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like this.  Might have liked it better with a tighter crop at the top ... just a little over the water horizon.  Title it "Layers", although "Pacific" works just fine too.   :-P  Good luck.', '2014-11-28 18:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288300, 1135607, 30049, '<td valign="top">When this shows up on the front page everyone is going to say to themselves ... "why didn''t I think of that?".  :-D  Well played.</td>', 'When this shows up on the front page everyone is going to say to themselves ... "why didn''t I think of that?".  :-D  Well played.', '2014-11-28 18:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288356, 1135944, 112828, '<td valign="top">I didn''t like this at first.<br/> <br/>Then I did.<br/> <br/>Now I really do.  This is one of the best of the challenge IMO.<br/> <br/>I particularly like the road/path, whatever that is in front of the pens, and the numerous colorful birds (with just the right amount of detail!) are awesome.<br/> <br/>Really nails the whole Rhine II look, without being overly cliche.  Well done.  My only quibble is that I think I would have liked a little less sky for a more pano sort of look.</td>', 'I didn''t like this at first. Then I did. Now I really do.  This is one of the best of the challenge IMO. I particularly like the road/path, whatever that is in front of the pens, and the numerous colorful birds (with just the right amount of detail!) are awesome. Really nails the whole Rhine II look, without being overly cliche.  Well done.  My only quibble is that I think I would have liked a little less sky for a more pano sort of look.', '2014-11-29 01:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288357, 1135919, 112828, '<td valign="top">Of course!  I was waiting for something of this sort - and it''s BEANS, TONS OF BEANS!  <br/> <br/>I think it works wonderfully, and bet your score reflects that.  The one can that''s knocked over anomalously does bother me a little though.. (could be argued to be a good thing too though.. A little discord and all that..)</td>', 'Of course!  I was waiting for something of this sort - and it''s BEANS, TONS OF BEANS!   I think it works wonderfully, and bet your score reflects that.  The one can that''s knocked over anomalously does bother me a little though.. (could be argued to be a good thing too though.. A little discord and all that..)', '2014-11-29 01:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288358, 1135877, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very cool, a tighter crop would have given more interest I think, as I can''t really discern anything but the overall pattern at this scale.  <br/> <br/>Still, really cool.</td>', 'Very cool, a tighter crop would have given more interest I think, as I can''t really discern anything but the overall pattern at this scale.   Still, really cool.', '2014-11-29 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288359, 1135956, 112828, '<td valign="top">Seems familiar, but I can''t place it.  I''m guessing you either got in very late, or got stuck.  Great use of the opportunity.</td>', 'Seems familiar, but I can''t place it.  I''m guessing you either got in very late, or got stuck.  Great use of the opportunity.', '2014-11-29 01:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288360, 1135845, 112828, '<td valign="top">Too harsh on the eyes, oversharpened, or too much ''structure'' here - makes the vegetation feel ''crispy'' and too heavy.  Good layering though, the bottom part not being parallel does kinda break the effect up at the right hand side though.</td>', 'Too harsh on the eyes, oversharpened, or too much ''structure'' here - makes the vegetation feel ''crispy'' and too heavy.  Good layering though, the bottom part not being parallel does kinda break the effect up at the right hand side though.', '2014-11-29 01:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288361, 1135935, 112828, '<td valign="top">A bit yellow, if the sky had been a bit more balanced, I think I would have liked this more.  <br/> <br/>As it is, you still have a pretty cool image, but for some reason (I have NO idea why, all the elements are here) this doesn''t strike me strongly as being in the style of Gursky.  I do love the details though - I think I wish you had pointed the camera down more, I want to see what''s going on down there, on the streets.</td>', 'A bit yellow, if the sky had been a bit more balanced, I think I would have liked this more.   As it is, you still have a pretty cool image, but for some reason (I have NO idea why, all the elements are here) this doesn''t strike me strongly as being in the style of Gursky.  I do love the details though - I think I wish you had pointed the camera down more, I want to see what''s going on down there, on the streets.', '2014-11-29 01:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288362, 1135789, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Just a tad too much in one frame here though, as it''s hard to make out any interesting details.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Just a tad too much in one frame here though, as it''s hard to make out any interesting details.', '2014-11-29 01:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288363, 1135786, 112828, '<td valign="top">Is that a dog, or a horse?  I can''t quite tell.</td>', 'Is that a dog, or a horse?  I can''t quite tell.', '2014-11-29 01:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288364, 1135949, 112828, '<td valign="top">The slight skewing hurts this for me, and I don''t know if I like the large number of shadows...  Still, I love the blue and that texture.</td>', 'The slight skewing hurts this for me, and I don''t know if I like the large number of shadows...  Still, I love the blue and that texture.', '2014-11-29 01:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7288390, 1135917, 13077, '<td valign="top">The light looks good on the trees, also good amount of detail in the shadows and good color balance. It does have a good 2 dimensional and very detailed vibe to it.</td>', 'The light looks good on the trees, also good amount of detail in the shadows and good color balance. It does have a good 2 dimensional and very detailed vibe to it.', '2014-11-29 11:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
