(7288733, 1135788, 16148, '<td valign="top">I remember escalators like this in Taiwan.  The shopping carts have magnets in the wheels so they don''t roll while riding up and down.  A well deserved top three.  Congratulations!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-12-01 00:47:53.</i></td>', 'I remember escalators like this in Taiwan.  The shopping carts have magnets in the wheels so they don''t roll while riding up and down.  A well deserved top three.  Congratulations!', '2014-12-01 00:47:26.000000', '2014-12-01 00:47:53.000000', 0),
